RGB adjoint at first pixel:float64[1, 1, 1, 3] [[[[178.5, -76.5, 51]]]];expected[178.5,-76.5,51].
\image(figures/gatys_style_transfer_preprocess.svg)
// result_end
\caption(Fixed RGB-to-BGR preprocessing and its exact channel-permutation derivative. No host pixel arithmetic or fitted statistics are involved.)
